OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for homes near village set
OL,4,Afor step forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for up to 180 homes on the edge
OL,7,Fof a village in Leicestershire are set
OL,8,Fto take a step forward.
OL,10,FPlanning officers have recommended
OL,11,FHarborough District Council's planning
OL,12,Fcommittee approve an outline planning
OL,13,Fapplication for the development on land
OL,14,Fsouth of London Road in Great Glen.
OL,16,FAccording to planning documents, 40% of
OL,17,Fhomes in the proposed development, put
OL,18,Fforward by David Wilson Homes, would be
OL,19,Fclassed as affordable.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
