OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for homes near village set
OL,4,Afor step forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report prepared by council planning
OL,7,Fofficers stated there would be a
OL,8,F"substantial benefit" from the proposed
OL,9,Fdevelopment in terms of meeting general
OL,10,Fhousing and affordable housing need.
